// env_get is a real Muninn builtin, and this program is a real Muninn program.
//
// On the command line it prints your HOME. Here it traps: this page runs your
// edits inside your browser, and a program in someone else's tab does not get
// to read the environment of the machine that served the page.
//
// The message names the reason. Muninn's IO builtins are capability-gated:
// the host grants them one at a time, and a builtin the host did not grant
// fails loudly rather than quietly pretending.

let name: String = env_get("HOME");
print(name);
name;
